flowchart TD
  START --> Context[load_context] --> OrderDetails --> Symptoms[Symptom router]
  Symptoms -->|tier 2| Safety
  Symptoms -->|clarify| Synthesis
  Symptoms -->|catalog or general| Reasoner
  Reasoner -->|sales| Catalog[Live SQL catalog search]
  Catalog --> Specific{Specific product phrase?}
  Specific -->|yes: any category| ProductResult[Requested product facts: price + stock]
  Specific -->|no| Generic{Generic category request?}
  Generic -->|yes: any category| CategoryResult[Category products]
  Generic -->|no| Approx[Nearby alternatives, not orderable]
  ProductResult --> RxGate
  CategoryResult --> RxGate
  RxGate -->|Rx| Safety
  RxGate -->|OTC order| Confirm -->|confirmed| CreateOrder
  RxGate -->|catalog answer| Synthesis
  Approx --> Synthesis
  Reasoner -->|customer service| RAG
  Reasoner -->|chitchat| Synthesis
  Reasoner -->|order status| OrderStatus
  Reasoner -->|safety| Safety
  Reasoner -->|escalation| Escalate
  RAG --> Synthesis
  CreateOrder --> Synthesis
  OrderStatus --> Synthesis
  Safety --> Synthesis
  Escalate --> Synthesis
  Synthesis -->|grounded LLM or deterministic fallback| Guardrail --> Persist --> END
